,\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"User Query:\nWhat is the step-by-step procedure for getting an Exemption Slip?\n\nThe step-by-step procedure for getting an Exemption Slip is as follows:\n\n1. **Submit Requirements:**\n   - **Client Steps:** Present your Validated Student Identification Card and a Printed Letter request with attachment.\n   - **Agency Action:** The documents presented will be verified.\n   - **Fees to be Paid:** None\n   - **Processing Time:** 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible:** Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\n\n2. **Record and Issuance:**\n   - **Client Steps:** Sign the Logbook.\n   - **Agency Action:** The Exemption Slip will be issued.\n   - **Fees to be Paid:** None\n   - **Processing Time:** 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible:** Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\n\n3. **Provide Feedback:**\n   - **Client Steps:** Fill out the Customer Feedback Form / BOSES.\n   - **Agency Action:** The filled-out Customer Feedback Form will be received and monitored.\n   - **Fees to be Paid:** None\n   - **Processing Time:** 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible:** Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\n\nTotal Fees: None  \nTotal Processing Time: 3 Minutes\n\nSources: 69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1",