m\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"TOTAL: Php 200.00\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d\",\n      \"type\": \"Service\",\n      \"canonical_name\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP\",\n      \"aliases\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"location\": \"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\",\n      \"source\": \"services\",\n      \"content\": \"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"similarity\": 0.99,\n      \"rerank_score\": 0.99,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d\",\n        \"name\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-Validated Student Identification Card\",\n          \"-Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption)\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?\n\nThe process for ID RE-ISSUANCE is as follows:\n\n1. **Present old ID or Affidavit of Loss**: Present your old ID for card replacement or an affidavit of loss for a lost ID. The agency will receive and verify the affidavit of loss. No fees are required at this step, and it takes 1 minute. (Responsible: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA, OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n2. **Sign the Logbook**: Sign the logbook to receive an ID Reissuance Slip. No fees are required, and it takes 1 minute. (Responsible: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA, OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n3. **Fill out the Customer Feedback Form**: Fill out the form or scan the QR code provided. The agency will receive and monitor the filled-out form. No fees are required, and it takes 1 minute. (Responsible: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA, OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n4. **Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment**: Pay Php 200 at the Cashier's Office. This step takes 5 minutes. (Responsible: CASHIER'S Office)\n\n5. **Proceed to University Press for ID printing**: Follow the process for securing a school identification card. The total fee is Php 200.00.\n\nSources: 69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process id re-issuance","%process id re-issuance%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","aliases":"ID RE-ISSUANCE; IR; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","location":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z","source":"services","content":"Service: ID RE-ISSUANCE. Description: A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID.\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO); STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\n\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
