ther lost ID or request for a new ID.\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO); STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","requirements":["-Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID)"],"details":"A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID.\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO)","STEP 1:","CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 2:","CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook","AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 3:","CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 4:","CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment","AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment","FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200","PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office","STEP 5:","CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing","AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)","TOTAL: Php 200.00"],"contact":null,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z"}},{"id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students","aliases":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students; OEON&TS; Registrar","location":"Registrar","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z","source":"services","content":"Service: Onl