","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z","source":"services","content":"Service: STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:; Validated Student Identification Card; Excuse Letter. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); Guardian; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","name":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP","requirements":["CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:","Validated Student Identification Card","Excuse Letter"],"details":"The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\n\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)","Guardian","STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS","CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)","STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE","CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.","AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)","STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK","CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)","TOTAL Fees: None","TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes"],"contact":null,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z"}}],"model_prompt":"STRICT ANSWER TEMPLATE\nUser Query:\nHow do I get a Student Admission Slip?\n\nCONTEXT_JSON:\n{\n  \"retrieved_items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927\",\n      \"type\": \"Service\",\n      \"canonical_name\": \"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP\",\n      \"aliases\": \"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP; SAS; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"location\": \"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z\",\n      \"source\": \"services\",\n      \"content\": \"Service: STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:; Validated Student Identification Card; Excuse Letter. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); Guardian; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927\",\n        \"name\": \"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:\",\n          \"Validated Student Identification Card\",\n          \"Excuse Letter\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"Guardian\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"To get a Student Admission Slip, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your Validated Student Identification Card and an Excuse Letter signed by your guardian to the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU).\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and verify the excuse letter.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will issue the Admission Slip.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\nThere are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis. \n\nSources: 69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927.","response_text":"To get a Student Admission Slip, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your Validated Student Identification Card and an Excuse Letter signed by your guardian to the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU).\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and verify the excuse letter.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will issue the Admission Slip.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\nThere are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis. \n\nSources: 69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"How do I get a Student Admission Slip?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To get a Student Admission Slip, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your Validated Student Identification Card and an Excuse Letter signed by your guardian to the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU).\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and verify the excuse letter.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will issue the Admission Slip.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES.\n   - **Agency Action**: The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form.\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n\nThere are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis. \n\nSources: 69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":[],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["do get student admission slip","%do get student admission slip%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","record_id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","type":"Service","canonical_name":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP","aliases":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP; SAS; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T04:18:46.862Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:; Validated Student Identification Card; Excuse Letter. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); Guardian; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
