PONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","requirements":["-Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID)"],"details":"A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID.\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO)","STEP 1:","CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 2:","CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook","AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 3:","CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided","AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)","STEP 4:","CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment","AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment","FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200","PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office","STEP 5:","CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing","AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)","TOTAL: Php 200.00"],"contact":null,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z"}},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","similarity":0.99,"rerank_score":0.99,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","requirements":["-Validated Student Identification Card","-Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption)"],"details":"The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\n\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)","STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS","CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.","AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)","STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE","CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.","AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption