rpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
