 with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?\n\nThe process for ID RE-ISSUANCE is as follows:\n\n1. **Present old ID or Affidavit of Loss**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Present old ID for card replacement or affidavit of loss for lost ID.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n2. **Sign the Logbook**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Sign the Logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: ID Reissuance Slip.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n3. **Fill out the Customer Feedback Form**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n4. **Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives the payment.\n   - **Fees**: Php. 200\n   - **Processing Time**: 5 minutes\n   - **Person Responsible**: Cashier's Office\n\n5. **Proceed to University Press for ID printing**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Proceed to University Press for ID printing.\n   - **Agency Action**: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\n   - **Total Fees**: Php 200.00","response_text":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?\n\nThe process for ID RE-ISSUANCE is as follows:\n\n1. **Present old ID or Affidavit of Loss**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Present old ID for card replacement or affidavit of loss for lost ID.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n2. **Sign the Logbook**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Sign the Logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: ID Reissuance Slip.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n3. **Fill out the Customer Feedback Form**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n4. **Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives the payment.\n   - **Fees**: Php. 200\n   - **Processing Time**: 5 minutes\n   - **Person Responsible**: Cashier's Office\n\n5. **Proceed to University Press for ID printing**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Proceed to University Press for ID printing.\n   - **Agency Action**: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\n   - **Total Fees**: Php 200.00","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?\n\nThe process for ID RE-ISSUANCE is as follows:\n\n1. **Present old ID or Affidavit of Loss**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Present old ID for card replacement or affidavit of loss for lost ID.\n   - **Agency Action**: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss.\n   - **Fees**: None\n   - **Processing Time**: 1 minute\n   - **Person Responsible**: Twyla B. Garces/Vincent Rey Cainila (OVPCASSS Staff)\n\n2. **Sign the Logbook**:\n   - **Client Steps**: Sign the Logbook.\n   - **Agency Action**: ID Reissuance Slip.\n   - **Fees**: None\n  