cation\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Certifies/Verifies Certificate of Enrollment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mr. Roy E. Tagarao/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Analene Grace P. Pagas/Administrative Aid |||, Mr. Earl Warren D. Caterial/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Janet C. Cahatol/Administrative Aid |||\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the validation of enrollment Accounting\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Validates (for paying students only)\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID:\",\n          \"COB, COE, COT, CAS: P225.00/unit, Misc. Fee: P2,482.50\",\n          \"CON: P450.00/unit, Misc Fee:P4,070.00, RLE:P20,281.62\",\n          \"MASTERS: P400.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,570.00\",\n          \"DOCTORATE: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,370.00\",\n          \"LAW: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P3,020.00\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 6 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Window 7- Kristrine B. Leria/Administrative Aid |||, Window 8- Liza B. Lambo/Administrative Aid |||, Window 9- Arvil A. Batobato/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Minnelli G. Tumulak/Administrative Officer |, Ms. Karen D. Achacoso/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Eunice E. Meliston/Cashier |||\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 55 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for Online Enrollment?\n\nThe process for Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students is as follows:\n\n1. **Visit the Online Enrollment Platform**: Go to [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph) and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the credentials you upload. (Processing time: 4 minutes)\n\n2. **Apply and Upload Documents**: Apply for your desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR) on the platform. (Processing time: 30 minutes)\n\n3. **Review the COR**: Download and review your Certificate of Registration. The enrollment officer will approve your enrollment application. (Processing time: 10 minutes)\n\n4. **Submit Original Documents**: Submit the original copies of your documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of your Certificate of Enrollment. (Processing time: 5 minutes)\n\n5. **Validation of Enrollment**: Proceed to the accounting department for validation (for paying students only). Fees vary by program. (Processing time: 6 minutes)\n\nTotal processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","response_text":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for Online Enrollment?\n\nThe process for Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students is as follows:\n\n1. **Visit the Online Enrollment Platform**: Go to [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph) and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the credentials you upload. (Processing time: 4 minutes)\n\n2. **Apply and Upload Documents**: Apply for your desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR) on the platform. (Processing time: 30 minutes)\n\n3. **Review the COR**: Download and review your Certificate of Registration. The enrollment officer will approve your enrollment application. (Processing time: 10 minutes)\n\n4. **Submit Original Documents**: Submit the original copies of your documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of your Certificate of Enrollment. (Processing time: 5 minutes)\n\n5. **Validation of Enrollment**: Proceed to the accounting department for validation (for paying students only). Fees vary by program. (Processing time: 6 minutes)\n\nTotal processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process for Online Enrollment?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"User Query:\nWhat is the process for Online Enrollment?\n\nThe process for Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students is as follows:\n\n1. **Visit the Online Enrollment Platform**: Go to [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph) and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the credentials you upload. (Processing time: 4 minutes)\n\n2. **Apply and Upload Documents**: Apply for your desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR) on the platform. (Processing time: 30 minutes)\n\n3. **Review the COR**: Download and review your Certificate of Registration. The enrollment officer will approve your enrollment application. (Processing time: 10 minutes)\n\n4. **Submit Original Documents**: Submit the original copies of your documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of your Certificate of Enrollment. (Processing time: 5 minutes)\n\n5. **Validation of Enrollment**: Proceed to the accounting department for validation (for paying students only). Fees vary by program. (Processing time: 6 minutes)\n\nTotal processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"engli