E: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"},{"id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","record_id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students","aliases":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students; OEON&TS; Registrar","location":"Registrar","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T06:42:09.089Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students. Description: High School/Senior High School graduates and Transferees from other private or government HEIs can apply for enrollment using the Online Enrollment platform at admissions.buksu.edu.ph Office or Division: University Registrar's Office Classification: Complex Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: External Clients (BukSU Students). Requirements: High School Graduate; Original Form 138; Original Good Moral certificate. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Senior High School Last School attended; c. Photocopy of PSA Birth Certificate; WHERE TO SECURE:; Philippine Statistics Authority; d. Report of Rating; WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission and Testing Unit; Transferee; a. Honorable Dismissal; b. Copy of Official Transcript of Records; c. Original Good Moral Certificate; WHERE TO SECURE:; Last School attended; d. Photocopy of PSA Birth Certificate; WHERE TO SECURE:; Philippine Statistics Authority; e. Accomplished Subject Equivalency Form (for students with credited courses); WHERE TO SECURE:; BUKSU Website https://buksu.edu.ph/downloadabl