t\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"TOTAL: Php 200.00\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d\",\n      \"type\": \"Service\",\n      \"canonical_name\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP\",\n      \"aliases\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"location\": \"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\",\n      \"source\": \"services\",\n      \"content\": \"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"similarity\": 0.99,\n      \"rerank_score\": 0.99,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d\",\n        \"name\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-Validated Student Identification Card\",\n          \"-Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption)\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"No information found.","response_text":"No information found.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What are the requirements needed for issuance of permit to stay overnight and extended use of university facilities? Facilities Management?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"No information found.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"suggested_matches":[{"id":"698576acab4685e7555b087f","canonical_name":"Facilities Mana