d submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","record_id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students","aliases":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students; COEEFICS; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:59.659Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T11:50:58.908Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students. Description: This refers to the actual conduct of admission test of which the result shall serve as pre-requisite and basis for enrollment to any programs prescribed by the college offering the course. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates; Transferees & Returnees; ALS Graduates; and Second Courses. Requirements: -Printed Test Permit (1 printed copy); -Printed Application Form (1 printed copy). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","record_id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Claiming of Examination Result","aliases":"Claiming of Examination Result; COER; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T11:50:58.908Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Claiming of Examination Result. Description: This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"}]}}
