ion test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","name":"Claiming of Examination Result","requirements":[],"details":"This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result.\nOffice or Division: Admission and Testing  Unit (ATU)\nClassification: Simple\nType of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph","STEP 1:","CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph","ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician)"],"contact":null,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z"}}],"chosen_match":{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Claiming of Examination Result"},"chosen_similarity_score":100,"model_prompt":"STRICT ANSWER TEMPLATE\nUser Query:\nUnsaon pag kuha sa Examination Result?\n\nCONTEXT_JSON:\n{\n  \"retrieved_items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da\",\n      \"type\": \"Service\",\n      \"canonical_name\": \"Claiming of Examination Result\",\n      \"aliases\": \"Claiming of Examination Result; COER; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)\",\n      \"location\": \"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z\",\n      \"source\": \"services\",\n      \"content\": \"Service: Claiming of Examination Result. Description: This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da\",\n        \"name\": \"Claiming of Examination Result\",\n        \"requirements\": [],\n        \"details\": \"This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result.\\nOffice or Division: Admission and Testing  Unit (ATU)\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph\",\n          \"STEP 1:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph\",\n          \"ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician)\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"User Query:\nUnsaon pag kuha sa Examination Result?\n\nTo claim your examination result, follow these steps:\n\n1. Log in to your admission account at [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](http://admissions.buksu.edu.ph).\n2. The results will be uploaded to the admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.\n3. There are no fees to be paid.\n4. The processing time is approximately 5 minutes.\n\nThe person responsible for this process is Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel, the ATU Psychometrician.","response_text":"User Query:\nUnsaon pag kuha sa Examination Result?\n\nTo claim your examination result, follow these steps:\n\n1. Log in to your admission account at [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](http://admissions.buksu.edu.ph).\n2. The results will be uploaded to the admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.\n3. There are no fees to be paid.\n4. The processing time is approximately 5 minutes.\n\nThe person responsible for this process is Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel, the ATU Psychometrician.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"Unsaon pag kuha sa Examination Result?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"User Query:\nUnsaon pag kuha sa Examination Result?\n\nTo claim your examination result, follow these steps:\n\n1. Log in to your admission account at [admissions.buksu.edu.ph](http://admissions.buksu.edu.ph).\n2. The results will be uploaded to the admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.\n3. There are no fees to be paid.\n4. The processing time is approximately 5 minutes.\n\nThe person responsible for this process is Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel, the ATU Psychometrician.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":[],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["unsaon pag kuha sa examination result","%unsaon pag kuha sa examination result%"],"matches":[{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","record_id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Claiming of Examination Result","aliases":"Claiming of Examination Result; COER; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T11:50:58.908Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Claiming of Examination Result. Description: This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"6999aeccda317950fbb7466f","record_id":"6999aeccda317950fbb7466f","type":"Building","canonical_name":"CPAG bldg.","aliases":"CPAG bldg.; Una