Y ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944\",\n        \"name\": \"ID RE-ISSUANCE\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID)\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID.\\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO)\",\n          \"STEP 1:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"TOTAL: Php 200.00\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Keep answer concise and factual.","model_response":"The ID re-issuance is a process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either a lost ID or a request for a new ID. It is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University and is handled by the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services. The requirements include presenting the old ID for a new request or replacement due to damage, or an Affidavit of Loss for a lost ID. The total fee for the process is Php 200.","response_text":"The ID re-issuance is a process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either a lost ID or a request for a new ID. It is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University and is handled by the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services. The requirements include presenting the old ID for a new request or replacement due to damage, or an Affidavit of Loss for a lost ID. The total fee for the process is Php 200.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"what is ID re issuance?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The ID re-issuance is a process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either a lost ID or a request for a new ID. It is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University and is handled by the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services. The requirements include presenting the old ID for a new request or replacement due to damage, or an Affidavit of Loss for a lost ID. The total fee for the process is Php 200.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["id re issuance","%id re issuance%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","record_id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","aliases":"ID RE-ISSUANCE; IR; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","location":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:01:51.903Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T12:03:46.775Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: ID RE-ISSUANCE. Description: A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO); STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","record_id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES","aliases":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES; IOPTSOAEUOUF; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:38.647Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T12:03:46.775Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES. Description: The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Student Identification Card; Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities.. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s Office; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST; CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
