P 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps:\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute and is handled by Aaron Rod O. Corpuz or Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLeDevU). No fees are required.\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute and involves the same personnel. No fees are required.\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the completed form. This step takes about 1 minute, with no fees required.\nThe total processing time is approximately 3 minutes.","response_text":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps:\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute and is handled by Aaron Rod O. Corpuz or Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLeDevU). No fees are required.\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute and involves the same personnel. No fees are required.\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the completed form. This step takes about 1 minute, with no fees required.\nThe total processing time is approximately 3 minutes.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the step-by-step procedure for getting an Exemption Slip?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps:\n1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute and is handled by Aaron Rod O. Corpuz or Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLeDevU). No fees are required.\n2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute and involves the same personnel. No fees are required.\n3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the completed form. This step takes about 1 minute, with no fees required.\nThe total processing time is approximately 3 minutes.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["step-by-step procedure getting exemption slip","%step-by-step procedure getting exemption slip%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","record_id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T06:07:35.842Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CL