487,0.5838249004665584,0.5571611332717762,0.5101699268751957],"final_context":[{"id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES","aliases":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES; IOPTSOAEUOUF; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:38.647Z","source":"services","content":"Service: ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES. Description: The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Student Identification Card; Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities.. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s Office; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST; CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","name":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES","requirements":["Validated Student Identification Card","Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities."],"details":"The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period.\n\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\nClassification: Simple\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)","College Dean’s Office","STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST","CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.","AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)","STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION","CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.","AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 3 m