n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"To get an ID re-issued, you need to present your old ID if you are requesting a new one or replacing a damaged one. If your ID is lost, you must provide an Affidavit of Loss, which can be secured from the Public Attorney's Office (PAO).","response_text":"To get an ID re-issued, you need to present your old ID if you are requesting a new one or replacing a damaged one. If your ID is lost, you must provide an Affidavit of Loss, which can be secured from the Public Attorney's Office (PAO).","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"what are the requirements of getting  ID RE-ISSUANCE?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To get an ID re-issued, you need to present your old ID if you are requesting a new one or replacing a damaged one. If your ID is lost, you must provide an Affidavit of Loss, which can be secured from the Public Attorney's Office (PAO).","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["requirement get id re-issuance","%requirement get id re-issuance%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","record_id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","aliases":"ID RE-ISSUANCE; IR; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","location":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Stud