ND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"},{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","record_id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ID RE-ISSUANCE","aliases":"ID RE-ISSUANCE; IR; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","location":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","last_updated":"2026-04-06T15:32:42.201Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:32:42.200Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: ID RE-ISSUANCE. Description: A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO); STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"}]}}
