mer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d\",\n        \"name\": \"EXEMPTION SLIP\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-Validated Student Identification Card\",\n          \"-Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption)\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps: 1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute. 2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute. 3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form. This step takes about 1 minute. There are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff members are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit.","response_text":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps: 1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute. 2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute. 3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form. This step takes about 1 minute. There are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff members are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the step-by-step procedure for getting an Exemption Slip?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To get an Exemption Slip, follow these steps: 1. **Submit Requirements**: Present your validated Student Identification Card and a printed letter request with an attachment explaining the reason for exemption. The staff will verify the documents. This step takes about 1 minute. 2. **Record and Issuance**: Sign the logbook. The staff will then issue the Exemption Slip. This step also takes about 1 minute. 3. **Provide Feedback**: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form/BOSES. The staff will receive and monitor the filled-out form. This step takes about 1 minute. There are no fees for this process, and the total processing time is approximately 3 minutes. The responsible staff members are Aaron Rod O. Corpuz and Jarey Mae E. Baylosis from the Student Leadership & Development Unit.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"i