. Earl Warren D. Caterial/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Janet C. Cahatol/Administrative Aid |||\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the validation of enrollment Accounting\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Validates (for paying students only)\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID:\",\n          \"COB, COE, COT, CAS: P225.00/unit, Misc. Fee: P2,482.50\",\n          \"CON: P450.00/unit, Misc Fee:P4,070.00, RLE:P20,281.62\",\n          \"MASTERS: P400.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,570.00\",\n          \"DOCTORATE: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,370.00\",\n          \"LAW: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P3,020.00\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 6 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Window 7- Kristrine B. Leria/Administrative Aid |||, Window 8- Liza B. Lambo/Administrative Aid |||, Window 9- Arvil A. Batobato/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Minnelli G. Tumulak/Administrative Officer |, Ms. Karen D. Achacoso/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Eunice E. Meliston/Cashier |||\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 55 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves several steps. First, visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. Next, apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. Then, download and review the Certificate of Registration (COR). After that, submit the original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2. Finally, proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","response_text":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves several steps. First, visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. Next, apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. Then, download and review the Certificate of Registration (COR). After that, submit the original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2. Finally, proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process for Online Enrollment?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves several steps. First, visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. Next, apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. Then, download and review the Certificate of Registration (COR). After that, submit the original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2. Finally, proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process online enrollment","%process online enrollment%"],"matches":[{"id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","record_id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","type":"Service","canonical_name":