P 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944\",\n        \"name\": \"ID RE-ISSUANCE\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID)\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID.\\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO)\",\n          \"STEP 1:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"TOTAL: Php 200.00\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-04-06T15:32:42.201Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for ID re-issuance involves the following steps: 1. Present your old ID for replacement or an affidavit of loss for a lost ID at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports, and Student Services (OVPCASSS). The staff will verify the affidavit of loss. 2. Sign the logbook to receive an ID reissuance slip. 3. Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the provided QR code. 4. Proceed to the Cashier's Office to pay a fee of Php 200. 5. Go to the University Press for ID printing. This service is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University.","response_text":"The process for ID re-issuance involves the following steps: 1. Present your old ID for replacement or an affidavit of loss for a lost ID at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports, and Student Services (OVPCASSS). The staff will verify the affidavit of loss. 2. Sign the logbook to receive an ID reissuance slip. 3. Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the provided QR code. 4. Proceed to the Cashier's Office to pay a fee of Php 200. 5. Go to the University Press for ID printing. This service is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process for ID RE-ISSUANCE?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for ID re-issuance involves the following steps: 1. Present your old ID for replacement or an affidavit of loss for a lost ID at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports, and Student Services (OVPCASSS). The staff will verify the affidavit of loss. 2. Sign the logbook to receive an ID reissuance slip. 3. Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the provided QR code. 4. Proceed to the Cashier's Office to pay a fee of Php 200. 5. Go to the University Press for ID printing. This service is available to all enrolled students of Bukidnon State University.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process id re-issuance","%process id re-issuance%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bc42ec22a8ee1742944","record_id":"69b