 the client; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","record_id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students","aliases":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students; COEEFICS; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:59.659Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:39:53.139Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students. Description: This refers to the actual conduct of admission test of which the result shall serve as pre-requisite and basis for enrollment to any programs prescribed by the college offering the course. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates; Transferees & Returnees; ALS Graduates; and Second Courses. Requirements: -Printed Test Permit (1 printed copy); -Printed Application Form (1 printed copy). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","record_id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Claiming of Examination Result","aliases":"Claiming of Examination Result; COER; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:39:53.139Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Claiming of Examination Result. Description: This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","record_id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","type":"Service","canonical_name":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP","aliases":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP; SAS; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:39:53.138Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP. Description: The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:; Validated Student Identification Card; Excuse Letter. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); Guardian; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"},{"id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","record_id":"69b81ce9faa024ce0ad051d0","type":"Service","canonical_name":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES","aliases":"ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES; IOPTSOAEUOUF; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:38.647Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:39:53.139Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: ISSUANCE OF PERMIT TO STAY OVERNIGHT AND EXTENDED USE OF UNIVERSITY FACILITIES. Description: The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Student Identification Card; Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities.. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s Office; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST; CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
