:33:42.877Z","source":"services","content":"Service: Claiming of Examination Result. Description: This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","similarity":1,"rerank_score":1,"rerank_signals":{"exactCanonical":true,"exactAlias":false,"phraseCanonical":true,"phraseAlias":false,"sameTypeBoost":0,"stalenessPenalty":0},"structured":{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","name":"Claiming of Examination Result","requirements":[],"details":"This refers to the release of the examinee's admission test result.\nOffice or Division: Admission and Testing  Unit (ATU)\nClassification: Simple\nType of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\nWho may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers","process_steps":["WHERE TO SECURE:","Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph","STEP 1:","CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph","ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.","FEES TO BE PAID: None","PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes","PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician)"],"contact":null,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T14:33:42.877Z"}}],"chosen_match":{"id":"69bf9b03355a381b553ea9da","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Claiming of Examination Result"},"chosen_similarity_score":100,"model_prompt":"STRICT ANSWER TEMPLATE\nUser Query:\nHow do I get my Examination Result?\n\nCONTEXT_JSON:\n{\n  \"retrieved_i