 TIME: 30 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer\",\n          \"STEP 3:\",\n          \"CLIENTS STEPS: Download and review the COR\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Approves the enrollment application\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Certifies/Verifies Certificate of Enrollment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mr. Roy E. Tagarao/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Analene Grace P. Pagas/Administrative Aid |||, Mr. Earl Warren D. Caterial/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Janet C. Cahatol/Administrative Aid |||\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the validation of enrollment Accounting\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Validates (for paying students only)\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID:\",\n          \"COB, COE, COT, CAS: P225.00/unit, Misc. Fee: P2,482.50\",\n          \"CON: P450.00/unit, Misc Fee:P4,070.00, RLE:P20,281.62\",\n          \"MASTERS: P400.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,570.00\",\n          \"DOCTORATE: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,370.00\",\n          \"LAW: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P3,020.00\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 6 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Window 7- Kristrine B. Leria/Administrative Aid |||, Window 8- Liza B. Lambo/Administrative Aid |||, Window 9- Arvil A. Batobato/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Minnelli G. Tumulak/Administrative Officer |, Ms. Karen D. Achacoso/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Eunice E. Meliston/Cashier |||\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 55 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"To enroll as a new transferee student, you need to use the Online Enrollment platform at admissions.buksu.edu.ph. The requirements include an Honorable Dismissal, a copy of your Official Transcript of Records, an Original Good Moral Certificate from your last school attended, a photocopy of your PSA Birth Certificate, and an Accomplished Subject Equivalency Form from the BUKSU website. The process involves logging into the online platform, applying for your desired program, uploading the necessary documents, and submitting original copies to the designated windows. Finally, proceed to the validation of enrollment for paying students.","response_text":"To enroll as a new transferee student, you need to use the Online Enrollment platform at admissions.buksu.edu.ph. The requirements include an Honorable Dismissal, a copy of your Official Transcript of Records, an Original Good Moral Certificate from your last school attended, a photocopy of your PSA Birth Certificate, and an Accomplished Subject Equivalency Form from the BUKSU website. The process involves logging into the online platform, applying for your desired program, uploading the necessary documents, and submitting original copies to the designated windows. Finally, proceed to the validation of enrollment for paying students.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"unsaon pag enrollment of new transferee student?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To enroll as a new transferee student, you need to use the Online Enrollment platform at admissions.buksu.edu.ph. The requir