Enrollment\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mr. Roy E. Tagarao/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Analene Grace P. Pagas/Administrative Aid |||, Mr. Earl Warren D. Caterial/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Janet C. Cahatol/Administrative Aid |||\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the validation of enrollment Accounting\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Validates (for paying students only)\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID:\",\n          \"COB, COE, COT, CAS: P225.00/unit, Misc. Fee: P2,482.50\",\n          \"CON: P450.00/unit, Misc Fee:P4,070.00, RLE:P20,281.62\",\n          \"MASTERS: P400.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,570.00\",\n          \"DOCTORATE: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,370.00\",\n          \"LAW: P600.00/unit, Misc Fee: P3,020.00\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 6 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Window 7- Kristrine B. Leria/Administrative Aid |||, Window 8- Liza B. Lambo/Administrative Aid |||, Window 9- Arvil A. Batobato/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Minnelli G. Tumulak/Administrative Officer |, Ms. Karen D. Achacoso/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Eunice E. Meliston/Cashier |||\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 55 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves the following steps: 1. Visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the uploaded credentials. 2. Apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR). 3. Download and review the COR. The enrollment officer will approve the enrollment application. 4. Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of the Certificate of Enrollment. 5. Proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The fees vary depending on the program and include unit fees and miscellaneous fees. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","response_text":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves the following steps: 1. Visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the uploaded credentials. 2. Apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR). 3. Download and review the COR. The enrollment officer will approve the enrollment application. 4. Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of the Certificate of Enrollment. 5. Proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The fees vary depending on the program and include unit fees and miscellaneous fees. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process for Online Enrollment?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for online enrollment for new and transferee students involves the following steps: 1. Visit the link https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in to your account. The enrollment officer will evaluate the uploaded credentials. 2. Apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements. The enrollment officer will load the subjects and upload the Certificate of Registration (COR). 3. Download and review the COR. The enrollment officer will approve the enrollment application. 4. Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2 for certification and verification of the Certificate of Enrollment. 5. Proceed to the validation of enrollment at the Accounting department for paying students. The fees vary depending on the program and include unit fees and miscellaneous fees. The total processing time is approximately 55 minutes.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process online enrollment","%process online enrollment%"],"matches":[{"id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","record_id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students","role_title":"Registrar","aliases":"Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students; OEON&TS; Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students service; Registrar","location":"Registrar","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:02:51.755Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T13:06:49.304Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Online Enrollment of New & Transferee Students. Role/Title: Registrar. Description: High School/Senior High School graduates and Transferees from other private or government HEIs can apply for enrollment using the Online Enrollment platform at admissions.buksu.edu.ph Office or Division: University Registrar's Office Classification: Complex Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: External Clients (BukSU