ission test result. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: BukSU-CAT, COL & GPAT Takers. Requirements: . Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Login to admissions.buksu.edu.ph; ACTION AGENCY: Upload to admissions system 15 working days after the last conduct of BukSU-CAT/COL/GPAT.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician). Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"}]}}
