oller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","record_id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students; COEEFICS; Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:59.659Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T13:10:13.190Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the actual conduct of admission test of which the result shall serve as pre-requisite and basis for enrollment to any programs prescribed by the college offering the course. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates; Transferees & Returnees; ALS Graduates; and Second Courses. Requirements: -Printed Test Permit (1 printed copy); -Printed Application Form (1 printed copy). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","record_id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","role_title":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; EXEMPTION SLIP service; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T13:10:13.190Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Role/Title: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
