e/Title: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Description: The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:; Validated Student Identification Card; Excuse Letter. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); Guardian; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"},{"id":"69bf98d4355a381b553ea9a6","record_id":"69bf98d4355a381b553ea9a6","type":"Office","canonical_name":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit is responsible for processing student applications, a