INILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69bf640e355a381b553ea8db","record_id":"69bf640e355a381b553ea8db","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card)","role_title":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","aliases":"Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card); V&AOSI(C; Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card) service; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS); VAOSIIC; vlidation activation of school id identification card; validation ativation of school id identification card; validation activation of shool id identification card; validation activation of school id ientification card; validation activation of school id identification crd; VAC; v asi c; VAOSIICS; vlidation activation of school id identification card service; validation ativation of school id identification card service; validation activation of shool id identification card service; validation activation of school id ientification card service; validation activation of school id identification crd service; validation activation of school id identification card srvice; OOTVPFCASASSO; ofice of the vice president for culture arts sports and student services ovpcasss; office of the vce president for culture arts sports and student services ovpcasss; office of the vice pesident for culture arts sports and student services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for clture arts sports and student services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture ats sports and student services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sorts and student services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and sudent services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student srvices ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student services opcasss","location":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","last_updated":"2026-04-05T12:06:34.790Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-05T12:06:34.790Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card). Role/Title: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). Description: Refers to the process of verifying the authenticity and legitimacy of a student's identification card and enrollment in the university. This is usually done every semester to ensure that only registered students can access campus facilities and services. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Certificate of Registration; Student Identification Card. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Download your COR at https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/ and proceed to the Accounting Office for validation; University Press; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Certificate of Registration and Identification Card; AGENCY ACTION: 1.1 Verifies data on Certificate of Registration and Identification Card 1.2 OVPCASSS staff activates the identification card, affixes the validation sticker for the specific semester, and then returns the ID to the student; FEES TO BE PAID: None; TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute and 30 seconds; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY G. CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff). Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ET; eafi1ys t; EEAFI1YSTS; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees srvice; AATUA; amission and testing unit atu; admission and tsting unit atu; admission and testing uit atu","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:09:10.745Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T14:45:56.819Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the service of processing admission test requirements and plotting of examination schedule for Senior High School, ALS graduates and Transferees who have the intention to enroll in any undergraduate programs of the university. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Complex Type of Transaction: G2C- Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates, Transferees and ALS Graduates. Requirements: -2X2 picture with white background; -Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement:; a. For Senior High School Graduates: Report Card/Certification as part of the graduating class signed by the Adviser/School Head; b. For Transferees: Scanned copy of Honorable Dismissal and Scanned copy of Transcript of Records; -For ALS Completer: Scanned copy of test result and Report Card for ALS indicating eligibility to enroll in Tertiary Education Institution. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Photo studio/Camera/Smart phones; School previously attended; Alternative Learning System community learning centers: ALS facilitator; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge coordinates with the Data Center to open the application link for BukSU-CAT; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; AGENCY ACTION: An Automated privacy and terms agreement will notify the client and request their consent for BukSU ATU to access their personal information. This ensures compliance with data and privacy laws and allows to provide academic and administrative services.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; AGENCY ACTION: The ATU sends automated email of activation link to the client; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","record_id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students; COEEFICS; Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); cnduct of entrance examination for incoming college students; conduct of etrance examination for incoming college students; conduct of entrance eamination for incoming college students; conduct of entrance examination for icoming college students; conduct of entrance examination for incoming cllege students; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college sudents; ceefics; COEEFICSS; cnduct of entrance examination for incoming college students service; conduct of etrance examination for incoming college students service; conduct of entrance eamination for incoming college students service; conduct of entrance examination for icoming college students service; conduct of entrance examination for incoming cllege students service; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college sudents service; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college students srvice; AATUA; amission and testing unit atu; admission and tsting unit atu; admission and testing uit atu","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:59.659Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T14:45:56.819Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the actual conduct of admission test of which the result shall serve as pre-requisite and basis for enrollment to any programs prescribed by the college offering the course. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates; Transferees & Returnees; ALS Graduates; and Second Courses. Requirements: -Printed Test Permit (1 printed copy); -Printed Application Form (1 printed copy). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"}]}}
