04-06T15:32:42.201Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-06T15:32:42.200Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: ID RE-ISSUANCE. Role/Title: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). Description: A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Old ID (for new ID request or replacement due to damage) or Affidavit of Loss (for lost ID). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO); STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook; AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ent; ent examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entr; entr examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entranc; entranc examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exa; entrance exa application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exam; entrance exam application for incoming 1st year students transferees; examinatio; entrance examinatio application for incoming 1st year students transferees; app; entrance examination app for incoming 1st year students transferees; appl; entrance examination appl for incoming 1st year students transferees; applicatio; entrance examination applicatio for incoming 1st year students transferees; inc; entrance examination application for inc 1st year students transferees; inco; entrance examination application for inco 1st year students transferees; incomin; entrance examination application for incomin 1st year students transferees; yea; entrance examination appli