 atu; adm; adm and testing unit atu; admi; admi and testing unit atu; admissio; admissio and testing unit atu; tes; admission and tes unit atu; test; admission and test unit atu; testin; admission and testin unit atu; uni; admission and testing uni atu","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:59.659Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T15:04:46.503Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the actual conduct of admission test of which the result shall serve as pre-requisite and basis for enrollment to any programs prescribed by the college offering the course. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates; Transferees & Returnees; ALS Graduates; and Second Courses. Requirements: -Printed Test Permit (1 printed copy); -Printed Application Form (1 printed copy). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","record_id":"69bfa5bc355a381b553ea9e6","type