: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Certificate of Registration; Student Identification Card. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Download your COR at https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/ and proceed to the Accounting Office for validation; University Press; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Certificate of Registration and Identification Card; AGENCY ACTION: 1.1 Verifies data on Certificate of Registration and Identification Card 1.2 OVPCASSS staff activates the identification card, affixes the validation sticker for the specific semester, and then returns the ID to the student; FEES TO BE PAID: None; TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute and 30 seconds; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY G. CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff). Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)"},{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ent; ent examination application for incoming 