r incoming 1st year sudents transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees srvice; ent examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entr examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entranc examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance exa application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance exam application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examinatio application for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination app for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination appl for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination applicatio for incoming 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for inc 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for inco 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for incomin 1st year students transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yea students transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year stu transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year stud transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year student transferees service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tra service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tran service; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferee service; ser; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees ser; serv; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees serv; servic; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees servic; AATUA; amission and testing unit atu; admission and tsting unit atu; admission and testing uit atu; adm; adm and testing unit atu; admi; admi and testing unit atu; admissio; admissio and testing unit atu; tes; admission and tes unit atu; test; admission and test unit atu; testin; admission and testin unit atu; uni; admission and testing uni atu","location":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:09:10.745Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T15:17:40.152Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the service of processing admission test requirements and plotting of examination schedule for Senior High School, ALS graduates and Transferees who have the intention to enroll in any undergraduate programs of the university. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Complex Type of Transaction: G2C- Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates, Transferees and ALS Graduates. Requirements: -2X2 picture with white background; -Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement:; a. For Senior High School Graduates: Report Card/Certification as part of the graduating class signed by the Adviser/School Head; b. For Transferees: Scanned copy of Honorable Dismissal and Scanned copy of Transcript of Records; -For ALS Completer: Scanned copy of test result and Report Card for ALS indicating eligibility to enroll in Tertiary Education Institution. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Photo studio/Camera/Smart phones; School previously attended; Alternative Learning System community learning centers: ALS facilitator; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge coordinates with the Data Center to open the application link for BukSU-CAT; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; AGENCY ACTION: An Automated privacy and terms agreement will notify the client and request their consent for BukSU ATU to access their personal information. This ensures compliance with data and privacy laws and allows to provide academic and administrative services.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; AGENCY ACTION: The ATU sends automated email of activation link to the client; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"},{"id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","record_id":"69bf9864355a381b553ea98f","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students; COEEFICS; Conduct of Entrance Examination for Incoming College Students service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); cnduct of entrance examination for incoming college students; conduct of etrance examination for incoming college students; conduct of entrance eamination for incoming college students; conduct of entrance examination for icoming college students; conduct of entrance examination for incoming cllege students; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college sudents; con; con of entrance examination for incoming college students; cond; cond of entrance examination for incoming college students; conduc; conduc of entrance examination for incoming college students; ent; conduct of ent examination for incoming college students; entr; conduct of entr examination for incoming college students; entranc; conduct of entranc examination for incoming college students; exa; conduct of entrance exa for incoming college students; exam; conduct of entrance exam for incoming college students; examinatio; conduct of entrance examinatio for incoming college students; inc; conduct of entrance examination for inc college students; inco; conduct of entrance examination for inco college students; incomin; conduct of entrance examination for incomin college students; col; conduct of entrance examination for incoming col students; coll; conduct of entrance examination for incoming coll students; colleg; conduct of entrance examination for incoming colleg students; stu; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college stu; stud; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college stud; student; conduct of entrance examination for incoming college student; ceefics; coe; coee; coeefic; COEEFICSS; cnduc