 for culture arts sports and stud services ovpcasss; studen; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and studen services ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student ser ovpcasss; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student serv ovpcasss; service; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student service ovpcasss; ovp; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student services ovp; ovpc; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student services ovpc; ovpcass; office of the vice president for culture arts sports and student services ovpcass\",\n      \"location\": \"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)\",\n      \"last_updated\": \"2026-04-05T12:06:34.790Z\",\n      \"source\": \"services\",\n      \"content\": \"Service: Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card). Role/Title: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). Description: Refers to the process of verifying the authenticity and legitimacy of a student's identification card and enrollment in the university. This is usually done every semester to ensure that only registered students can access campus facilities and services. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services Classification: Simple Type of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Certificate of Registration; Student Identification Card. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Download your COR at https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/ and proceed to the Accounting Office for validation; University Press; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Certificate of Registration and Identification Card; AGENCY ACTION: 1.1 Verifies data on Certificate of Registration and Identification Card 1.2 OVPCASSS staff activates the identification card, affixes the validation sticker for the specific semester, and then returns the ID to the student; FEES TO BE PAID: None; TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute and 30 seconds; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY G. CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff). Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69bf640e355a381b553ea8db\",\n        \"name\": \"Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card)\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"Validated Certificate of Registration\",\n          \"Student Identification Card\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"Refers to the process of verifying the authenticity and legitimacy of a student's identification card and enrollment in the university. This is usually done every semester to ensure that only registered students can access campus facilities and services.\\nOffice or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"Download your COR at https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/ and proceed to the Accounting Office for validation\",\n          \"University Press\",\n          \"STEP 1:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Certificate of Registration and Identification Card\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: 1.1 Verifies data on Certificate of Registration and Identification Card 1.2 OVPCASSS staff activates the identification card, affixes the validation sticker for the specific semester, and then returns the ID to the student\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute and 30 seconds\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY G. CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff)\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-04-05T12:06:34.790Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- For process/steps/how-to questions, use explicit numbered steps (1., 2., 3.).\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"To validate your ID, follow these steps: 1. Download your Certificate of Registration (COR) from https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/. 2. Proceed to the Accounting Office for validation. 3. Present your printed Certificate of Registration and Student Identification Card at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). 4. The OVPCASSS staff will verify your data, activate your identification card, affix the validation sticker for the specific semester, and return the ID to you. No fees are required, and the total processing time is approximately 1 minute and 30 seconds.","response_text":"To validate your ID, follow these steps: 1. Download your Certificate of Registration (COR) from https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/. 2. Proceed to the Accounting Office for validation. 3. Present your printed Certificate of Registration and Student Identification Card at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). 4. The OVPCASSS staff will verify your data, activate your identification card, affix the validation sticker for the specific semester, and return the ID to you. No fees are required, and the total processing time is approximately 1 minute and 30 seconds.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"Where can I validate my ID?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"To validate your ID, follow these steps: 1. Download your Certificate of Registration (COR) from https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph/. 2. Proceed to the Accounting Office for validation. 3. Present your printed Certificate of Registration and Student Identification Card at the Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). 4. The OVPCASSS staff will verify your data, activate your identification card, affix the validation sticker for the specific semester, and return the ID to you. No fees are required, and the total processing time is approximately 1 minute and 30 seconds.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"in-memory-cosine","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["validate id","%validate id%"],"matches":[{"id":"69bf640e355a381b553ea8db","record_id":"69bf640e355a381b553ea8db","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card)","role_title":"Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS)","aliases":"Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card); V&AOSI(C; Validation & Activation of School ID (Identification Card) service; Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS); VAOSIIC; vlidation activation of school id identification card; validation ativation of school id identification card; validation activation of shool id identification card; validation activat