fy the service: EXEMPTION SLIP. 2. Review details: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. 3. Prepare requirements: 1. -Validated Student Identification Card 2. -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption) 4. Follow the process: 1. WHERE TO SECURE: 2. University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card) 3. STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS 4. CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment. 5. AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented 6. FEES TO BE PAID: None 7. PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute 8. PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff) 9. STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE 10. CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook. 11. AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip 12. FEES TO BE PAID: None 13. PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute 14. PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff) 15. STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK 16. CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES. 17. AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form 18. FEES TO BE PAID: None 19. PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute 20. PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff) 21. TOTAL Fees: None 22. TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes 5. Contact the office for assistance: Not available.","response_text":"1. Identify the service: EXEMPTION SLIP. 2. Review details: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently m