. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; Admission account at admissions.buksu.edu.ph; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Present printed Test Permit and Application Form; AGENCY ACTION: Verify identification on the test permit and Application form presented. Distributes Test Booklets and Answer Sheets and administers examination; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit accomplished examination papers and sign attendance sheet; AGENCY ACTION: Collects answer sheets and retrieves test booklets; facilitates signing of attendance sheets; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Angel Sweet S. Berdiguel (ATU Psychometrician); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 2 hours and 5 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)"}]}}
