 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"TOTAL: Php 200.00\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-04-06T15:32:42.201Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- For requirements queries, format as \"[Service] requires ...\".\n- For description/what-is service queries, format as \"[Service] description is ...\".\n- For where-to-process queries, format as \"[Service] can be processed at ...\".\n- For process/steps/how-to questions, use short paragraph style and avoid numbered lists.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"ID RE-ISSUANCE process is A process of reissuing an Identification Card to a student due to either lost ID or request for a new ID. Office or Division: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports & Student Services Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. WHERE TO SECURE:, then Affidavit of Loss - Public Attorney's Office (PAO), then STEP 1:, then CLIENT STEPS: Present old ID for card replacement/affidavit of lost for lost ID, then AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the affidavit of loss, then FEES TO BE PAID: None, then PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute, then PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff), then STEP 2:, then CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook, then AGENCY ACTION: ID Reissuance Slip, then FEES TO BE PAID: None, then PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute, then PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff), then STEP 3:, then CLIENT STEPS: Fill out 