. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","record_id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","role_title":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; EXEMPTION SLIP service; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU); eemption slip; exemption sip; exe; exe slip; exem; exem slip; exemptio; exemptio slip; sli; exemption sli; ESS; eemption slip service; exemption sip service; exemption slip srvice; exe slip service; exem slip service; exemptio slip service; exemption sli service; ser; exemption slip ser; serv; exemption slip serv; servic; exemption slip servic; SLDUS; sudent leadership development unit sledevu; student ladership development unit sledevu; student leadership dvelopment unit sledevu; student leadership development uit sledevu; student leadership development unit sedevu; stu; stu leadership development unit sledevu; stud; stud leadership development unit sledevu; studen; studen leadership development unit sledevu; lea; student lea development unit sledevu; lead; student lead development unit sledevu; leadershi; student leadershi development unit sledevu; dev; student leadership dev unit sledevu; deve; student leadership deve unit sledevu; developmen; student leadership developmen unit sledevu; uni; student leadership development uni sledevu; sle; student leadership development unit sle; sled; student leadership development unit sled; sledev; student leadership development unit sledev","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T16:19:23.024Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Role/Title: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)"}]}}
