mplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Building: ADMIN bldg."},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","record_id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","role_title":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","aliases":"EXEMPTION SLIP; ES; EXEMPTION SLIP service; Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU); ADMIN bldg.; eemption slip; exemption sip; exe; exe slip; exem; exem slip; exemptio; exemptio slip; sli; exemption sli; ESS; eemption slip service; exemption sip service; exemption slip srvice; exe slip service; exem slip service; exemptio slip service; exemption sli service; ser; exemption slip ser; serv; exemption slip serv; servic; exemption slip servic; SLDUS; sudent leadership development unit sledevu; student ladership development unit sledevu; student leadership dvelopment unit sledevu; student leadership development uit sledevu; student leadership development unit sedevu; stu; stu leadership development unit sledevu; stud; stud leadership development unit sledevu; studen; studen leadership development unit sledevu; lea; student lea development unit sledevu; lead; student lead development unit sledevu; leadershi; studen