Title: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Description: The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: Validated Student Identification Card; Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities.. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s Office; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST; CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Building: ADMIN bldg."},{"id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","record_id":"69b81d756915f5fd64f7d74d","type":"Service","canonical_name":"EXEMPTION SLIP","role_title":"St