ne; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form or scan the QR code provided; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled out Customer Feedback form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the Cashier's Office for payment; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the payment; FEES TO BE PAID: Php. 200; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: CASHIER'S Office; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to University Press for ID printing; AGENCY ACTION: (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); TOTAL: Php 200.00. Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). Building: ADMIN bldg."},{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); CPAG bldg.; EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ent; ent examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entr; entr examination appli