 Admission and Testing Unit; Transferee; a. Honorable Dismissal; b. Copy of Official Transcript of Records; c. Original Good Moral Certificate; WHERE TO SECURE:; Last School attended; d. Photocopy of PSA Birth Certificate; WHERE TO SECURE:; Philippine Statistics Authority; e. Accomplished Subject Equivalency Form (for students with credited courses); WHERE TO SECURE:; BUKSU Website https://buksu.edu.ph/downloadable-forms/; STEP 1:; CLIENT STEPS: Visit the link: https://www.admissions.buksu.edu.ph and log in account; AGENCY ACTION: Evaluates the credentials being uploaded; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 4 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer; STEP 2:; CLIENT STEPS: Apply for the desired program, enroll, and upload the necessary documentary requirements; AGENCY ACTION: Loads the subjects and uploads the Certificate of Registration (COR) at https://admissions.buksu.edu.ph; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 30 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer; STEP 3:; CLIENTS STEPS: Download and review the COR; AGENCY ACTION: Approves the enrollment application; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: College/Department Enrollment Officer; STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit original copies of documentary requirements to Window 1 or 2; AGENCY ACTION: Certifies/Verifies Certificate of Enrollment; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mr. Roy E. Tagarao/Administrative Officer |||, Ms. Analene Grace P. Pagas/Administrative Aid |||, Mr. Earl Warren D. Caterial/Administrative Aid |||, Ms. Janet C. Cahatol/Administrative Aid |||; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to the validation of enrollment Accounting; AGENCY ACTION: Validates (for paying students only); FEES TO BE PAID:; COB, COE, COT, CAS: P225.00/unit, Misc. Fee: P2,482.50; CON: P450.00/unit, Misc Fee:P4,070.00, RLE:P20,281.62; MASTERS: P400.00/unit, Misc Fee: P2,570.00; DOCTORATE: P600.00/unit, Misc F