 30 seconds; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: TWYLA B. GARCES/VINCENT REY G. CAINILA (OVPCASSS Staff). Department: . Office: Office of the Vice President for Culture, Arts, Sports and Student Services (OVPCASSS). Building: ADMIN bldg."},{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); CPAG bldg.; EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ent; ent examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entr; entr examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entranc; entranc examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exa; entrance exa application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exam; entrance exam application for incoming 1st year students transferees; examinatio; entrance examinatio application for incoming 1st year students transferees; app; entrance examination app for incoming 1st year students transferees; appl; entrance examination appl for incoming 1st year students transferees; applicatio; entrance examination applicatio for incoming 1st year students transferees; inc; entrance examination application for inc 1