er Feedback Form; TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes","is_active":true,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:08:47.946Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-07T23:42:51.565Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: EXEMPTION SLIP. Role/Title: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Description: The exemption slip serves as a crucial tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University. Requirements: -Validated Student Identification Card; -Letter request (Attachment to the declared reason for exemption). Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS; CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Printed Letter request with attachment.; AGENCY ACTION: Verify documents presented; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.; AGENCY ACTION: Issue Exemption Slip; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 Minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development