us facilities.. Process Steps: WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s Office; STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUEST; CLIENT STEPS: Accomplish the Permit to Stay Overnight and Extended Use of Campus Facilities signed by the Instructor.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives the accomplished form and process request; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 2: RECORD TRANSACTION; CLIENT STEPS: Sign the log book of transactions to record the transaction.; AGENCY ACTION: Release the permit; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 3 minutes; RESPONSIBLE PERSON: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitor filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 7 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Building: ADMIN bldg."}]}}
