ent unit sledevu; student leadership development uit sledevu; student leadership development unit sedevu; stu; stu leadership development unit sledevu; stud; stud leadership development unit sledevu; studen; studen leadership development unit sledevu; lea; student lea development unit sledevu; lead; student lead development unit sledevu; leadershi; student leadershi development unit sledevu; dev; student leadership dev unit sledevu; deve; student leadership deve unit sledevu; developmen; student leadership developmen unit sledevu; student leadership development uni sledevu; sle; student leadership development unit sle; sled; student leadership development unit sled; sledev; student leadership development unit sledev; AB; amin bldg; admin bdg; adm; adm bldg; admi; admi bldg; bld; admin bld; service; services; serbisyo; process; procedure; steps; proseso; hakbang; lakang; requirements; required; kailangan; kinahanglan; location; where; saan; asa; nasaan; description; details; about; ano; unsa","category_tags":"service; process; requirements; location; description","department_name":"","assigned_building":"ADMIN bldg.","floor_location":"1","number_of_floors":"","location":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU), ADMIN bldg.","description":"The use by the student and student groups of university facilities beyond the normal school operating hours is a privilege. The University observes a curfew at 10:00 pm. Thus, the following shall be observed in granting requests for use of campus facilities beyond the curfew period. Office or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit Classification: Simple Type of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen Who may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University","requirements":"Validated Student Identification Card; Provide letter request to stay overnight and extended use of campus facilities.","process":"WHERE TO SECURE:; University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card); College Dean’s