ill notify the client and request their consent for BukSU ATU to access their personal information. This ensures compliance with data and privacy laws and allows to provide academic and administrative services.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; AGENCY ACTION: The ATU sends automated email of activation link to the client; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes. Department: . Office: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Building: CPAG bldg.\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"adjusted_score\": 1.1914285714285715,\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b\",\n        \"name\": \"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees\",\n        \"department\": null,\n        \"office_name\": \"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)\",\n        \"building_name\": \"CPAG  bldg.\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"-2X2 picture with white background\",\n          \"-Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement:\",\n          \"a. For Senior High School Graduates: Report Card/Certification as part of the graduating class signed by the Adviser/School Head\",\n          \"b. For Transferees: Scanned copy of Honorable Dismissal and Scanned copy of Transcript of Records\",\n          \"-For ALS Completer: Scanned copy of test result and Report Card for ALS indicating eligibility to enroll in Tertiary Education Institution\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"This refers to the service of processing admission test requirements and plotting of examination schedule for Senior High School, ALS graduates and Transferees who have the intention to enroll in any undergraduate programs of the university.\\nOffice or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)\\nClassification: Complex\\nType of Transaction: G2C- Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: High School Graduates, Transferees and ALS Graduates\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"Photo studio/Camera/Smart phones\",\n          \"School previously attended\",\n          \"Alternative Learning System community learning centers: ALS facilitator\",\n          \"STEP 1:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \\\"Register\\\" or \\\"Login\\\"\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge coordinates with the Data Center to open the application link for BukSU-CAT\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"STEP 2:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: An Automated privacy and terms agreement will notify the client and request their consent for BukSU ATU to access their personal information. This ensures compliance with data and privacy laws and allows to provide academic and administrative services.\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"STEP 3:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Access Gmail inbox to activate admission account\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: The ATU sends automated email of activation link to the client\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"STEP 4:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"STEP 5:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"STEP 6:\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule)\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 5 minutes\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Mark G. Ochavillo (Document Controller)\",\n          \"TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:09:10.745Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- For personnel who questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] is the head of [Office/Department]\".\n- For personnel where questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] can be found at [Office/Department/Room], [Building]\".\n- For requirements questions, format as \"To get [Service], you should have these requirements: ...\".\n- For process questions, format as \"The process for [Service] is ...\" using paragraph style only.\n- For description/what-is service questions, format as \"[Service] is ...\".\n- For where-to-process questions, format as \"[Service] can be processed at ...\".\n- Avoid numbered lists and avoid casual phrasing.\n- Use simple words and short active-voice sentences.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation.","response_text":"The process for **Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees** is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation. You can process this at **Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)**, CPAG bldg., Floor 1. Common requirements include 2X2 picture with white background and Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"How to apply for an Entrance Examination?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_category":"Process","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback