ic and administrative services.; STEP 3:; CLIENT STEPS: Access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; AGENCY ACTION: The ATU sends automated email of activation link to the client; PROCESSING TIME: 2 minutes; STEP 4:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement.; AGENCY ACTION: The Admission website prompts the client to provide the necessary information and uploaded the required documents to complete the application process.; PROCESSING TIME: 10 minutes; STEP 5:; CLIENT STEPS: Proceed to select date and time of the admission test.; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge manages and opens the examination schedules for applicants; STEP 6:; CLIENT STEPS: Submit the accomplished online application for evaluation; AGENCY ACTION: The admission in-charge evaluates the applications. (Evaluation is done per testing schedule); TOTAL PROCESSING TIME: 32 minutes","is_active":true,"last_updated":"2026-03-30T15:09:10.745Z","last_indexed":"2026-04-13T14:29:17.599Z","deactivated":false,"source":"services","content":"Service: Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees. Role/Title: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU). Description: This refers to the service of processing admission test requirements and plotting of examination schedule for Senior High School, ALS graduates and Transferees who have the intention to enroll in any undergraduate programs of the university. Office or Division: Admission and Testing Unit (ATU) Classification: Complex Type of Transaction: G2C- Government to Citizen Who may avail: High School Graduates, Transferees and ALS Graduates. Requirements: -2X2 picture with white background; -Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement:; a. For Senior High School Graduates: Report Card/Certification as part of the graduating class signed by the Adviser/School Head; b. For Transferees: Scanned copy of Honorable Dismissal and Scanned copy of Tran