aff); STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK; CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.; AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form; FEES TO BE PAID: None; PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute; PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff); TOTAL Fees: None; TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes. Department: . Office: Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU). Building: ADMIN bldg.\",\n      \"similarity\": 1,\n      \"rerank_score\": 1,\n      \"rerank_signals\": {\n        \"exactCanonical\": true,\n        \"exactAlias\": false,\n        \"phraseCanonical\": true,\n        \"phraseAlias\": false,\n        \"sameTypeBoost\": 0,\n        \"stalenessPenalty\": 0\n      },\n      \"adjusted_score\": 1.162857142857143,\n      \"structured\": {\n        \"id\": \"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927\",\n        \"name\": \"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP\",\n        \"department\": null,\n        \"office_name\": \"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)\",\n        \"building_name\": \"ADMIN bldg.\",\n        \"requirements\": [\n          \"CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS:\",\n          \"Validated Student Identification Card\",\n          \"Excuse Letter\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": \"The exemption slip serves as a tool in the university’s administrative framework, aiming to efficiently manage and formalize the process of excusing students for valid reasons. Aligned with established policies and procedures, it provides a transparent and fair mechanism for temporary absences from classes, events, or requirements.\\n\\nOffice or Division: Student Leadership & Development Unit\\nClassification: Simple\\nType of Transaction: G2C-Government to Citizen\\nWho may avail: All enrolled students of Bukidnon State University\",\n        \"process_steps\": [\n          \"WHERE TO SECURE:\",\n          \"University Press (Refer to process on Securing School Identification Card)\",\n          \"Guardian\",\n          \"STEP 1: SUBMIT REQUIREMENTS\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and verifies the excuse letter presented\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 2: RECORD AND ISSUANCE\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Sign the Logbook.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Issue Admission Slip\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"STEP 3: PROVIDE FEEDBACK\",\n          \"CLIENT STEPS: Fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.\",\n          \"AGENCY ACTION: Receives and monitors filled-out Customer Feedback Form\",\n          \"FEES TO BE PAID: None\",\n          \"PROCESSING TIME: 1 minute\",\n          \"PERSON RESPONSIBLE: Aaron Rod O. Corpuz / Jarey Mae E. Baylosis (SLeDevU Staff)\",\n          \"TOTAL Fees: None\",\n          \"TOTAL Processing Time: 3 minutes\"\n        ],\n        \"contact\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T14:42:52.858Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- For personnel who questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] is the head of [Office/Department]\".\n- For personnel where questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] can be found at [Office/Department/Room], [Building]\".\n- For requirements questions, format as \"To get [Service], you should have these requirements: ...\".\n- For process questions, format as \"The process for [Service] is ...\" using paragraph style only.\n- For description/what-is service questions, format as \"[Service] is ...\".\n- For where-to-process questions, format as \"[Service] can be processed at ...\".\n- Avoid numbered lists and avoid casual phrasing.\n- Use simple words and short active-voice sentences.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.","response_text":"The process for **STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP** is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES. You can process this at **Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)**, ADMIN bldg., Floor 1. Common requirements include CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS and Validated Student Identification Card.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"unsay process sa pagkuha ug admission slip?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_category":"Process","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"chromadb","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"category_filters":["process"],"metadata_filters":{"category":"","assigned_building":"","floor_location":""},"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["unsay process sa pagkuha ug admission slip","%unsay process sa pagkuha ug admission slip%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","record_id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","type":"Servi