ice sentences.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"The process for STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.","response_text":"The process for **STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP** is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES. You can process this at **Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)**, ADMIN bldg., Floor 1. Common requirements include CHECKLIST OF REQUIREMENTS and Validated Student Identification Card.","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process of acquiring admission slip","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"The process for STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP is first, present Identification Card & Excuse letter signed by the guardian; next, sign the Logbook; finally, fill out the Customer Feedback Form /BOSES.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_category":"Process","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"chromadb","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"category_filters":["process"],"metadata_filters":{"category":"","assigned_building":"","floor_location":""},"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process acquir admission slip","%process acquir admission slip%"],"matches":[{"id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","record_id":"69b81bad2ec22a8ee1742927","type":"Service","category":"service","canonical_name":"STUDENT ADMISSION SLIP","role_title":"Student Leadership & Development Unit (SLEDEVU)","aliases":"STUDENT 