erified\",\n        \"effectiveDate\": null,\n        \"expirationDate\": null,\n        \"last_updated\": \"2026-03-30T15:09:10.745Z\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nInstructions:\n- Use only facts present in CONTEXT_JSON.\n- Treat responsible office/source office fields as the stakeholder that provided or owns the information.\n- If missing, return the exact no-info sentence.\n- Never fill missing university information with assumptions or general knowledge.\n- Return exactly one answer with professional grammar and natural phrasing.\n- For personnel who questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] is the head of [Office/Department]\".\n- For personnel where questions, format as \"[Personnel Name] can be found at [Office/Department/Room], [Building]\".\n- For requirements questions, format as \"To get [Service], you should have these requirements: ...\".\n- For process questions, format as \"The process for [Service] is ...\" using paragraph style only.\n- For description/what-is service questions, format as \"[Service] is ...\".\n- For where-to-process questions, format as \"[Service] can be processed at ...\".\n- Avoid numbered lists and avoid casual phrasing.\n- Use simple words and short active-voice sentences.\n- Keep the answer concise and factual.\n- Do not include headings or labels (e.g., \"Answer:\", \"User Query:\", \"Context:\").","model_response":"According to verified information from Admission and Testing Unit (ATU), the process for Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation.","response_text":"According to verified information from **Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)**, the process for **Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees** is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation. You can process this at **Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)**, CPAG bldg., Floor 1. Common requirements include 2X2 picture with white background and Scanned copy of Documentary Requirement.","response_type":"VERIFIED_ANSWER","verification_status":"verified","knowledge_source":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","model_response_language":"english","final_response_language":"english","translation_steps":{"query":{"text":"What is the process Claiming Examination result?","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"},"response":{"text":"According to verified information from Admission and Testing Unit (ATU), the process for Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees is first, access admissions.buksu.edu.ph on a browser and click \"Register\" or \"Login\"; next, register an active email address and create a password. Read the privacy and terms agreement to next steps; next, access Gmail inbox to activate admission account; next, proceed to complete the online application by providing the required information and submission of documentary requirement; next, proceed to select date and time of the admission test; finally, submit the accomplished online application for evaluation.","sourceLanguage":"english","targetLanguage":"english","translated":false,"method":"none"}},"retrieval_category":"Service","retrieval_mode":"exact_fallback","vector_db":"chromadb","embedding_model":"hash-embedding-v1","type_filters":["Service"],"category_filters":["service"],"metadata_filters":{"category":"","assigned_building":"","floor_location":"","stakeholder":"","source_office":""},"fallback":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM items WHERE canonical_name = ? OR aliases LIKE ? LIMIT 5","params":["process claim examination result","%process claim examination result%"],"matches":[{"id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","record_id":"69bf72bb355a381b553ea96b","type":"Service","category":"service","canonical_name":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees","role_title":"Admission and Testing Unit (ATU)","aliases":"Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees; EEAFI1YS&T; Entrance Examination Application for Incoming 1st Year Students & Transferees service; Admission and Testing Unit (ATU); CPAG bldg.; EEAFI1YST; etrance examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance eamination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination aplication for incoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for icoming 1st year students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st yar students transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year sudents transferees; entrance examination application for incoming 1st year students tansferees; ent; ent examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entr; entr examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; entranc; entranc examination application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exa; entrance exa application for incoming 1st year students transferees; exam; entrance exam application 